    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MicroProbe: Efficient Reliability Assessment for Foundation Models with Minimal Data
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bansal%2C+A">Aayam Bansal</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gangwani%2C+I">Ishaan Gangwani</a>
      
