    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        HTG-GCL: Leveraging Hierarchical Topological Granularity from Cellular Complexes for Graph Contrastive Learning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ji%2C+Q">Qirui Ji</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qin%2C+B">Bin Qin</a>, 
      
